      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈呼~只有到了秋天，\r\n才能这么悠闲地读书呢~……\r\n咦？书忘记带了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4588aac406d548f53434eb64eb796987572d1d2a3cb42b61ec83643083b5f2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
