      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "凉凉的空气，逐渐被太阳包围……\r\n哈啊~~~\r\n春天很棒，冬天也不错，对吧~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "372dff62e04b5109a97bda81f23d7561aed90c571ea715e1a659241e7e29ff21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
